      {
        "type": "text",
        "id": "page-duo-p-1",
        "name": "page-duo-p-1",
        "x": 42,
        "y": 465,
        "fill": "#111111",
        "content": "Duo does it all. Hucards & CD-ROM2. Duo is the ultimate all-in-one NEC video game system. Duo features an original-style cartridge slot, controller port and CD-ROM drive. This means it is compatible with all game formats: Hucards, TurboChips, and CD-ROM. Plus the original hardware and accessories.",
        "fontFamily": "Helvetica Neue",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "fontWeight": "500",
        "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
        "width": 306,
        "height": 154
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "id": "page-duo-p-2",
        "name": "page-duo-p-2",
        "x": 42,
        "y": 637,
        "fill": "#111111",
        "content": "We&#x27;re Preserving Video Game History with FPGA Hardware. Unlike traditional emulators that mimic console behavior through software, FPGA recreates the original hardware at the circuit level. It doesn&#x27;t just simulate—it behaves exactly like the original system, delivering unparalleled accuracy, flawless timing, and true-to-life performance.",
        "fontFamily": "Helvetica Neue",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "fontWeight": "500",
        "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
        "width": 306,
        "height": 191
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "id": "page-duo-p-3",
        "name": "page-duo-p-3",
        "x": 42,
        "y": 846,
        "fill": "#111111",
        "content": "Physical Compatibility FPGA: Can directly interface with original cartridges, discs and accessories because it recreates the console at the electrical + timing level. Everything behaves like original hardware.",
        "fontFamily": "Helvetica Neue",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "fontWeight": "500",
